{"candidateAnswer":"The second week of January 2023, right after the holidays.","evidence":"[D3:1 | 8:30 pm on 1 January, 2023] John: Hey Maria, great to chat again! I joined a service-focused online group last week and it's been an emotional ride. Everyone there is incredible with their own inspiring stories. They've opened my eyes to new perspectives, and I'm feeling a sense of connection and purpose with them.","itemId":"urn:uuid:6550712a-138c-5665-91a9-c5485d6967fa","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:919ad7b3d4a4c5c0be601ca0b9d1adb2b74ac1fa6febc5add64756f49be7b11d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John join the online support group?","referenceAnswer":"The week before 1 January 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"919ad7b3d4a4c5c0be601ca0b9d1adb2b74ac1fa6febc5add64756f49be7b11d"}}]}